bDate>Wed, 4 Nov 2026 14:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59639</s:story_id></item><item><title>WVU to Cap Regular Season at Cincinnati</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/4/womens-soccer-wvu-to-cap-regular-season-at-cincinnati</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/4/womens-soccer-wvu-to-cap-regular-season-at-cincinnati</guid><category>Women's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Alexis Pashales battles against a defender during a match at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium in Morgantown." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/4/ex1_106.jpg" /><br /><br />CINCINNATI, Ohio – The West Virginia University women's soccer team prepares for its regular-season finale at Cincinnati on Thursday, Nov. 5. Kickoff at Gettler Stadium in Cincinnati, Ohio, is set for 7 p.m. ET.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/4/ex1_106.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/4/ex1_106.jpg"><media:title>Alexis Pashales battles against a defender during a match at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium in Morgantown.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/4/ex1_106.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:02:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>13</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59638</s:story_id></item><item><title>WVU to Face No. 13 Texas Tech in Rare 9:30 Kickoff Time on Saturday Night</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/4/football-wvu-to-face-no-13-texas-tech-in-rare-9-30-kickoff-time-on-saturday-night</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/4/football-wvu-to-face-no-13-texas-tech-in-rare-9-30-kickoff-time-on-saturday-night</guid><categ