/3/BBD00405.JPG" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/3/BBD00405.JPG"><media:title>Gia Cooke defends a Rhode Island player in the Mountaineers season opening win</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/3/BBD00405.JPG" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:10:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59634</s:story_id></item><item><title>Gymnastics Reveals 2027 Schedule</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/3/gymnastics-reveals-2027-schedule</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/3/gymnastics-reveals-2027-schedule</guid><category>Gymnastics</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="GYM27_Schedule Release_1920x1080" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/2/GYM27__SCHEDULE_1920x1080.png" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University Department of Intercollegiate Athletics, along with the Big 12 Conference, has announced the 2027 gymnastics schedule.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/2/GYM27__SCHEDULE_1920x1080.png" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/2/GYM27__SCHEDULE_1920x1080.png"><media:title>GYM27_Schedule Release_1920x1080</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/2/GYM27__SCHEDULE_1920x1080.png" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>11</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59630</s:story_id></item><item><title>Purdue Added to 2027 Football Schedule</title><